{"id":"8ffba7376827cc25","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-effective-global-sections.md","title":"有效拓扑斯的全局元素","display":"df-effective-global-sections — 有效拓扑斯的全局元素","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-effective-global-sections","display":"df-effective-global-sections — 有效拓扑斯的全局元素","depends_on":["[[16-df-eff-topos]]","[[16-df-set]]","[[16-df-functor]]"],"source":"Lemma 6.2.1 p. 385 (PDF 405)","revision_date":"2026-10-19","aliases":["16-df-effective-global-sections"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-effective-global-sections"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-global-sections — 有效拓扑斯的全局元素"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b6311019c9acbb97\" href=\"?note=b6311019c9acbb97\" title=\"16-df-eff-topos\">16-df-eff-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Lemma 6.2.1 p. 385 (PDF 405)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-effective-global-sections</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbf{Eff}\">\\((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbf{Eff}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[F]:(I,\\rho)\\to(J,\\sigma)\">\\([F]:(I,\\rho)\\to(J,\\sigma)\\)</span> 是按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b6311019c9acbb97\" href=\"?note=b6311019c9acbb97\" title=\"16-df-eff-topos\">16-df-eff-topos</a> 构造的态射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为其严格、外延、单值、全定义的功能关系代表。</li>\n<li>下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0,J_0\">\\(I_0,J_0\\)</span> 为有存在证据的元素集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\approx_\\rho,\\approx_\\sigma\">\\(\\approx_\\rho,\\approx_\\sigma\\)</span> 为对应商等价关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[i]_\\rho,[j]_\\sigma\">\\([i]_\\rho,[j]_\\sigma\\)</span> 表示商类。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J,\\sigma\">\\(J,\\sigma\\)</span> 使用同一构造，不另引入新的定义规则。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(I,\\rho)\">\\(A=(I,\\rho)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=(J,\\sigma)\">\\(B=(J,\\sigma)\\)</span>；完整 Eff 箭头为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A,B,[F]\\rangle\">\\(\\langle A,B,[F]\\rangle\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma[F]\">\\(\\Gamma[F]\\)</span> 是固定源靶时的裸函数图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_1\">\\(\\Gamma_1\\)</span> 是其带源靶的集合范畴箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 与 Eff 的基底宇宙相同。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nI_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{i\\in I\\mid\\rho(i,i)\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\\\\ni\\approx_\\rho i&#39;&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\rho(i,i&#39;)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\qquad(i,i&#39;\\in I_0),\\\\\n\\Gamma(I,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq I_0/{\\approx_\\rho},\\\\\n\\Gamma[F]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle[i]_\\rho,[j]_\\sigma\\rangle\\mid\ni\\in I_0\\land j\\in J_0\\land F(i,j)\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma[F]&amp;:\\Gamma(I,\\rho)\\to\\Gamma(J,\\sigma),\\\\\n\\Gamma_0(I,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Gamma(I,\\rho),\\\\\n\\Gamma_1\\langle A,B,[F]\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma_0(A),\\Gamma_0(B),\\Gamma[F]\\rangle,\\\\\n\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma_0,\\Gamma_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\Gamma,\\mathbf{Eff},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nI_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{i\\in I\\mid\\rho(i,i)\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\\\\ni\\approx_\\rho i&#39;&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\rho(i,i&#39;)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\qquad(i,i&#39;\\in I_0),\\\\\n\\Gamma(I,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq I_0/{\\approx_\\rho},\\\\\n\\Gamma[F]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle[i]_\\rho,[j]_\\sigma\\rangle\\mid\ni\\in I_0\\land j\\in J_0\\land F(i,j)\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma[F]&amp;:\\Gamma(I,\\rho)\\to\\Gamma(J,\\sigma),\\\\\n\\Gamma_0(I,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Gamma(I,\\rho),\\\\\n\\Gamma_1\\langle A,B,[F]\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma_0(A),\\Gamma_0(B),\\Gamma[F]\\rangle,\\\\\n\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma_0,\\Gamma_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\Gamma,\\mathbf{Eff},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Lemma 6.2.1, p. 385 (PDF 405)。PER 的对称/传递实现函数保证支撑上的普通等价关系。全定义性使每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[i]\">\\([i]\\)</span> 有输出，单值性使输出商类唯一，外延性使更换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 的代表不改变输出；功能关系的逻辑等价保证更换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的代表也不改变图。因此所示集合是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(I,\\rho)\\to\\Gamma(J,\\sigma)\">\\(\\Gamma(I,\\rho)\\to\\Gamma(J,\\sigma)\\)</span> 的函数图，不需任意挑选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>，也不需在 Assertion 中写自然语言 where。关系复合的存在量词与图复合一致，故得到全局元素函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Eff}(1,-)\">\\(\\mathbf{Eff}(1,-)\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-eff-topos","status":"resolved","id":"b6311019c9acbb97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-eff-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eff-topos","status":"resolved","id":"b6311019c9acbb97","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbf{Eff}$，$[F]:(I,\\rho)\\to(J,\\sigma)$ 是按 [[16-df-eff-topos]] 构造的态射，$F$ 为其严格、外延、单值、全定义的功能关系代表。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"下文 $I_0,J_0$ 为有存在证据的元素集，$\\approx_\\rho,\\approx_\\sigma$ 为对应商等价关系；$[i]_\\rho,[j]_\\sigma$ 表示商类。对 $J,\\sigma$ 使用同一构造，不另引入新的定义规则。$A=(I,\\rho)$、$B=(J,\\sigma)$；完整 Eff 箭头为 $\\langle A,B,[F]\\rangle$。$\\Gamma[F]$ 是固定源靶时的裸函数图，$\\Gamma_1$ 是其带源靶的集合范畴箭头。$\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Functor}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-set]]、[[16-df-functor]]，$\\mathcal U$ 与 Eff 的基底宇宙相同。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"下文 $I_0,J_0$ 为有存在证据的元素集，$\\approx_\\rho,\\approx_\\sigma$ 为对应商等价关系；$[i]_\\rho,[j]_\\sigma$ 表示商类。对 $J,\\sigma$ 使用同一构造，不另引入新的定义规则。$A=(I,\\rho)$、$B=(J,\\sigma)$；完整 Eff 箭头为 $\\langle A,B,[F]\\rangle$。$\\Gamma[F]$ 是固定源靶时的裸函数图，$\\Gamma_1$ 是其带源靶的集合范畴箭头。$\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Functor}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-set]]、[[16-df-functor]]，$\\mathcal U$ 与 Eff 的基底宇宙相同。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbf{Eff}","display":false},{"tex":"[F]:(I,\\rho)\\to(J,\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"I_0,J_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\approx_\\rho,\\approx_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"[i]_\\rho,[j]_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"J,\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A=(I,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"B=(J,\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A,B,[F]\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma[F]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nI_0&\\coloneqq\\{i\\in I\\mid\\rho(i,i)\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\\\\ni\\approx_\\rho i'&\\Longleftrightarrow\\rho(i,i')\\ne\\varnothing\n\\qquad(i,i'\\in I_0),\\\\\n\\Gamma(I,\\rho)&\\coloneqq I_0/{\\approx_\\rho},\\\\\n\\Gamma[F]&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle[i]_\\rho,[j]_\\sigma\\rangle\\mid\ni\\in I_0\\land j\\in J_0\\land F(i,j)\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma[F]&:\\Gamma(I,\\rho)\\to\\Gamma(J,\\sigma),\\\\\n\\Gamma_0(I,\\rho)&\\coloneqq\\Gamma(I,\\rho),\\\\\n\\Gamma_1\\langle A,B,[F]\\rangle&\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma_0(A),\\Gamma_0(B),\\Gamma[F]\\rangle,\\\\\n\\Gamma&\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma_0,\\Gamma_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\Gamma,\\mathbf{Eff},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"[i]","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma(I,\\rho)\\to\\Gamma(J,\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Eff}(1,-)","display":false}],"bytes":2414,"backlinks":[{"id":"07a1592023f10b9f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定足够大的宇宙使本页的 $\\mathbf{Eff}$、$\\mathbf{PER}$ 及族范畴可按小范畴编码；大小层次与 [[16-df-grothendieck-construction]] 一致。$A=(I,\\rho)\\in\\mathbf{Eff}$，$E(i)=\\rho(i,i)$、$I_0=\\{i\\in I\\mid E(i)\\ne\\varnothing\\}$；$\\Gamma A$ 及只在 $I_0$ 上使用的 $[i]$ 采用 [[16-df-effective-global-sections]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-pca]]、[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]、[[16-df-realizability-fibration]]、[[16-df-set-of-fibration]]、[[16-df-eff-topos]]、[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]、[[16-df-assembly]]、[[16-df-per-category]]、[[16-df-ufam-per]]、[[16-df-context-category]]、[[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]、[[16-df-type-functor]]、[[16-df-term-functor]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]、[[16-thm-reynolds]]。"},{"id":"198e3b21cd4c6cd2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}$、$\\mathbf{Eff}$ 及 $\\Gamma$ 采用 [[16-df-assembly]]、[[16-df-effective-global-sections]] 的范畴与全局截面构造。$A=(I,\\rho)$、$B=(J,\\sigma)$ 为Eff对象；$H=\\langle A,B,[R]\\rangle:A\\to B$ 为Eff的带标签箭头。"},{"id":"c18e2a4a9af5e4cb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma:\\mathbf{Eff}\\to\\mathbf{Set}$ 采用 [[16-df-effective-global-sections]]。"}],"outgoing":["b6311019c9acbb97","09b2ae01fb2d54e3","fc49efccd7348d66"]}